# jAER plan location

When creating or updating Cursor plans for this repository, always write them under:

`.cursor/plans/`

(resolved from the jAER repo root, e.g. `jaer/.cursor/plans/…`).

## Do

- Put new `.plan.md` files in `.cursor/plans/`
- Prefer descriptive names like `python_frame_ipc_shared_memory.plan.md`
- Keep plans in-repo so they sync across machines (Dropbox/git) for cross-platform jAER work

## Do not

- Write plans only to the user-global Cursor plans folder when the work is about this jAER repo
- Scatter plans under `docs/`, `/tmp`, or random paths unless the user explicitly asks
